<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 8.42 mln rand S.African bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 8.42 mln rand S.African bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 8.42 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday after selling 98.42 million rand on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
